    <string name="alert_high_title">High heart rate</string>
    <string name="alert_high_text">Your heart rate stayed high for a while, up to %1$d bpm.</string>
    <string name="alert_high_rest_text">当你休息时，你的心率保持在%1$dbpm以上超过10分钟（最高达到%2$dbpm）。</string>
    <string name="alert_high_sleep_text">当你睡着的时候，你的心率保持在%1$dbpm以上超过10分钟（最高达到%2$dbpm）。</string>
    <string name="alert_high_exercise_text">在运动过程中，你的心率保持在%1$dbpm以上，这是你通常的最大值，持续几分钟（达到%2$dbpm）。考虑慢下来。</string>
    <string name="alert_low_title">低心率</string>
    <string name="alert_spo2_low_title">低血氧读数</string>
    <string name="alert_spo2_low_text">连续三次读数显示血氧低于%1$d%%，低于你的上限%2$d%%。静静地坐着，再量一量；如果血压一直很低或你感到呼吸急促，请就医。</string>
    <string name="alert_spo2_nights_title">Lower blood oxygen in sleep</string>
    <string name="alert_spo2_nights_text">Your blood oxygen in sleep has been lower than usual. This can come with an illness, high altitude or breathing problems in sleep. Talk to a doctor if it continues.</string>
    <string name="alert_temp_title">比平常温暖的夜晚</string>
    <string name="alert_temp_text">你睡觉时的皮肤温度已经连续两晚比平时高了大约%1$s°C。休息，如果感觉不舒服，用体温计测量体温。</string>
    <string name="alert_stress_title">有压力的迹象</string>
    <string name="alert_stress_text">在大约一个小时的时间里，你的心率和它的变异性看起来都很紧张。一分钟的缓慢呼吸会有所帮助。</string>
    <string name="alert_breathe">深呼吸一分钟</string>
    <string name="breathe_in">吸气</string>
    <string name="breathe_out">Breathe out</string>
    <string name="breathe_done">Well done. How do you feel?</string>
    <string name="breathe_measure">Measure stress</string>
    <string name="breathe_close">关闭</string>
    <string name="alert_combined_title">你的身体可能在对抗什么</string>
    <string name="alert_combined_text">昨晚你的皮肤温度比平时高了大约%1$s°C，睡眠时你的心率也提高了。休息，多喝水，如果感觉不舒服，测量一下体温。</string>
    <string name="alert_high_rest_normal_text">当你休息的时候，你的心率保持在高水平超过10分钟：达到每分钟%1$d，比你平时的每分钟%3$d高%2$dq2qqq。</string>
    <string name="alert_high_sleep_normal_text">当你睡着的时候，你的心率会保持在高水平，持续10多分钟：达到每分钟%1$d，每分钟%2$d%%，高于你平时的每分钟%3$d。</string>
    <string name="alert_low_rest_normal_text">当你休息的时候，你的心率保持在低水平超过10分钟：下降到%1$dbpm，%2$d%%低于你平时的%3$dbpm。</string>
    <string name="alert_low_sleep_normal_text">While you were asleep, your heart rate stayed low for over 10 minutes: down to %1$d bpm, %2$d%% below your usual %3$d bpm in sleep.</string>
    <string name="alert_trend_title">Resting heart rate higher than usual</string>
    <string name="alert_trend_text">Your heart rate in sleep has been higher than usual for several nights (about %1$d bpm, usually %2$d). Rest, sleep and drink enough, and talk to a doctor if it continues.</string>
    <string name="alert_high_normal_title">静息心率100以上</string>
    <string name="alert_high_normal_text">这周你的静息心率在100 bpm以上。考虑和医生谈谈。</string>
    <string name="alert_low_text">你的心率低了一会儿，降到每分钟%1$d。</string>
    <string name="alert_low_rest_text">当你休息时，你的心率低于%1$dbpm超过10分钟（下降到%2$dbpm）。</string>
    <string name="alert_low_sleep_text">当你睡着时，你的心率低于%1$dbpm超过10分钟（下降到%2$dbpm）。</string>
